<p>Our main metric is our Google rank for the bare word in three countries. A GitHub Action checks Google and Brave every day with the same settings since 31 October and publishes this dashboard and the raw data. So we can show trends over three weeks, not one lucky screenshot. Results differ by country and browser, so the lecturer’s own snapshot can differ slightly from ours.</p>
