<p>This is what you would approve. Three products, each with a job: the sticker sheet is the entry item, the poster the teaching item, the tote the signature item. Our positioning is merchandise that teaches: every product has a QR code. The poster code opens the seabird guide and the same game you played at the start. So the merchandise reuses everything we built for search, instead of starting from zero. These are prototypes, not products for sale; Mario designed the mockups.</p>
